    <item>
      <title>tip 0.1.0-beta.1</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:36:26 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0-beta.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:12px 14px;color:#222}h3{font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 4px}ul{padding-left:18px;margin:4px 0}li{margin:2px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace}a{color:#0a64d0}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#ddd}a{color:#6ab0ff}}</style><h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>add tip, a native menu bar with islands, themes and plugins (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/03a4df680ab32be65b5aad58d61ea48f20cdbff0">03a4df6</a>)</li>
<li><b>animation:</b> add animation.contentMs for an item's own content changes, 80 ms by default (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
<li><b>island:</b> add island.bare so an item floats without a card, the Apple logo by default (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
<li><b>markets:</b> use the Nerd Font glyphs for BTC, ETH, gas and NYSE when a Nerd Font is installed (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
<li><b>network:</b> split the VPN into its own item and label the link kind (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/7215e7b01e62adeb5119ae9762c71f85dff6c915">7215e7b</a>)</li>
<li><b>render:</b> draw private-use glyphs with an installed Nerd Font (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
<li><b>workspaces:</b> glide the visible workspace highlight to its new place (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Performance</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>cpu:</b> read every process every 10 s and only the busiest 16 in between (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
<li><b>paw:</b> draw a workspace focus change at once instead of waiting on a query round trip (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
<li><b>render:</b> bound the render cache by 2 MB of bitmaps instead of 512 entries (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
<li><b>render:</b> draw bitmaps in BGRA and pre-rasterize app icons and symbols at device size (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/commit/82f9e553f4b3d5e8cc4b9e026bcf9c846f0e7686">82f9e55</a>)</li>
</ul><p><a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/tip/releases/tag/v0.1.0-beta.1">Release on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
